# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NATIONS. Chapter two is fought against three of them, each with its own
# colours and its own way of making war. A tour belongs to one nation; TOTAL
# WAR is all of them at once, which is why its waves arrive in three colours.
#
# `swap` remaps the wave planner's output to the nation's doctrine, so the
# same wave reads completely differently depending on who is sending it.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
